                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "- The empty track Record\/Play records next meters its input in grey #6E6E73, 4.1:1 on the tile: the selected track, or one with a record arm waiting. Other empty tracks stay dark, so tracks sharing an input do not move together."
